<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="da">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>DR Podcasts</title>
    <meta
            name="description"
            content="Genudgivelse af podcasts fra DR som RSS, uden forsinkelser."
    />

    <!-- Pico.css -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/pico.min.css" />
    <style>
        a:hover { text-decoration: none; }
        #podcasts td, #podcasts th { vertical-align: middle; }
        #podcasts tbody tr { cursor: pointer; }
        #podcasts tbody tr[hidden] { display: none; }
        /* An explicit column width, and max-width:none so Pico's img rule cannot
           clamp the cover to the width of a column that .name has squeezed to zero. */
        #podcasts th:first-child, #podcasts td:first-child { width: 56px; }
        #podcasts .cover { width: 56px; height: 56px; max-width: none; border-radius: 6px; display: block; }
        #podcasts .name { width: 100%; font-weight: bold; }
        #podcasts th.sortable { cursor: pointer; user-select: none; white-space: nowrap; }
        #podcasts th.sortable::after { content: " \2195"; opacity: 0.3; }
        #podcasts th.sortable[aria-sort="ascending"]::after { content: " \2191"; opacity: 1; }
        #podcasts th.sortable[aria-sort="descending"]::after { content: " \2193"; opacity: 1; }
        #podcasts .episodes, #podcasts .latest { white-space: nowrap; text-align: right; }
        #podcasts .actions { text-align: right; }
        #podcasts .actions button { margin: 0; padding: 0.3rem 0.7rem; font-size: 0.8rem; white-space: nowrap; }
        #empty { display: none; }
        .sr-only {
            position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden;
            clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0;
        }
        #details { padding: 0; }
        #details .cover { width: 120px; height: 120px; border-radius: 8px; float: left; margin: 0 1rem 1rem 0; }
        #details .description { white-space: pre-wrap; }
        #details .feed { display: block; clear: both; word-break: break-all; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        #details header h3 { margin-bottom: 0; }
        #details footer { text-align: left; }
        #details footer button { width: auto; }
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            #podcasts .latest { display: none; }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
<a href="https://github.com/drpodcastnu">
    <img style="position: absolute; right: 0; width:40px; height:40px; margin: 15px;" src="github-mark.png"/>
</a>
<!-- Header -->
<header class="container">
    <hgroup>
        <h1>DR Podcasts</h1>
        <h2>Genudgivelse af podcasts fra DR som RSS, uden forsinkelser.</h2>
    </hgroup>
</header>
<!-- ./ Header -->
<!-- Main -->
<main class="container">
    <section>
        <h2>Podcasts</h2>
        <input type="search" id="search" placeholder="Søg efter podcast…" aria-label="Søg efter podcast" autocomplete="off" />
        <p><small id="count"></small></p>
        <table id="podcasts">
            <thead>
            <tr>
                <th scope="col"><span class="sr-only">Billede</span></th>
                <th scope="col" class="sortable" data-sort="title">Podcast</th>
                <th scope="col" class="episodes sortable" data-sort="episodes">Afsnit</th>
                <th scope="col" class="latest sortable" data-sort="latest">Seneste afsnit</th>
                <th scope="col" class="actions"><span class="sr-only">Handlinger</span></th>
            </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
            {{#podcasts}}
            <tr data-slug="{{slug}}" data-title="{{title}}" data-episodes="{{episodes}}" data-latest="{{latestEpisode}}" data-description="{{description}}">
                <td><img class="cover" src="{{slug}}/image.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" /></td>
                <td class="name">{{title}}</td>
                <td class="episodes">{{episodes}}</td>
                <td class="latest">{{latestEpisode}}</td>
                <td class="actions"><button class="secondary copy" type="button">Kopiér RSS</button></td>
            </tr>
            {{/podcasts}}
            </tbody>
        </table>
        <p id="empty">Ingen podcasts matcher søgningen.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h2>Hvad er dette?</h2>
        <p>DR har for nyligt valgt at et udvalg af deres podcasts ikke længere skal være tilgængelige som RSS-feeds, eller at de RSS-feeds de publicerer er forsinkede med flere dage. Dette betyder at du som lytter ikke kan bruge den app du foretrækker, men at du bliver tvunget til at bruge DR's app "DR Lyd".</p>
        <p>Argumentet som DR bruger er, at de ikke vil lade store techgiganter som Spotify bestemme over DR's indhold. Dette argument giver ikke nogen mening, da DR samtidig også afskærer alle andre 3. parts apps fra at abonnere på deres podcasts.</p>
        <p>Dette går direkte imod DR's public service forpligtelser, og svarer til at bestemme at du kun må bruge en radio produceret af DR til at lytte til DR's programmer. I værste fald er DR med til yderligere at normalisere tendensen til, at indhold gemmes bag betalingsmure og proprietære apps i stedet for at blive gjort tilgængeligt via de åbne web-standarder der allerede findes, og som sikrer at folk kan bruge den software de foretrækker.</p>
        <p>De RSS-feeds du kan finde på denne side kan du importere i de fleste RSS-læsere som understøtter import af vilkårlige RSS URL'er. Med tiden kan det også være at du vil kunne finde dem direkte i den app du foretrækker, såfremt deres indekseringsrobot har fundet dem.</p>
    </section>
</main>

<dialog id="details">
    <article>
        <header>
            <button aria-label="Luk" rel="prev" class="close" type="button"></button>
            <h3 id="details-title"></h3>
        </header>
        <img class="cover" id="details-cover" alt="" />
        <p class="description" id="details-description"></p>
        <footer>
            <a class="feed" id="details-feed" href="#"></a>
            <button class="copy" id="details-copy" type="button">Kopiér RSS-URL</button>
        </footer>
    </article>
</dialog>

<script>
    (function () {
        var table = document.getElementById("podcasts");
        var rows = Array.prototype.slice.call(table.tBodies[0].rows);
        var search = document.getElementById("search");
        var count = document.getElementById("count");
        var empty = document.getElementById("empty");
        var dialog = document.getElementById("details");

        // Fold Danish letters so "moerklagt" finds "Mørklagt".
        function fold(text) {
            return text
                .toLowerCase()
                .normalize("NFD")
                .replace(/[̀-ͯ]/g, "")
                .replace(/æ/g, "ae")
                .replace(/ø/g, "oe")
                .replace(/å/g, "aa");
        }

        rows.forEach(function (row) {
            row.dataset.search = fold(row.dataset.title);
        });

        function feedUrl(slug) {
            return new URL(slug + "/feed.xml", window.location.href).href;
        }

        function copyText(text) {
            if (navigator.clipboard && window.isSecureContext) {
                return navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);
            }
            // Clipboard API needs https, so fall back for local files and plain http.
            var field = document.createElement("textarea");
            field.value = text;
            field.setAttribute("readonly", "");
            field.style.position = "fixed";
            field.style.opacity = "0";
            document.body.appendChild(field);
            field.select();
            try {
                document.execCommand("copy");
                return Promise.resolve();
            } catch (error) {
                return Promise.reject(error);
            } finally {
                document.body.removeChild(field);
            }
        }

        function confirmCopy(button, slug) {
            var original = button.textContent;
            copyText(feedUrl(slug)).then(
                function () { button.textContent = "Kopieret!"; },
                function () { button.textContent = "Kunne ikke kopiere"; }
            ).then(function () {
                window.setTimeout(function () { button.textContent = original; }, 1500);
            });
        }

        // The server already emits newest-first; mirror that as the initial state.
        var sort = { key: "latest", direction: -1 };
        var firstDirection = { title: 1, episodes: -1, latest: -1 };

        function sortValue(row, key) {
            if (key === "episodes") return Number(row.dataset.episodes);
            if (key === "latest") return row.dataset.latest || "";
            return row.dataset.title;
        }

        function applySort() {
            var ordered = rows.slice().sort(function (a, b) {
                var x = sortValue(a, sort.key);
                var y = sortValue(b, sort.key);
                var cmp = typeof x === "number" ? x - y : String(x).localeCompare(String(y), "da");
                // Undated shows sort last whichever way the date column points.
                if (sort.key === "latest" && x !== y && (x === "" || y === "")) return x === "" ? 1 : -1;
                return (cmp * sort.direction) || a.dataset.title.localeCompare(b.dataset.title, "da");
            });
            var body = table.tBodies[0];
            ordered.forEach(function (row) { body.appendChild(row); });
            Array.prototype.forEach.call(table.tHead.querySelectorAll("th.sortable"), function (th) {
                if (th.dataset.sort === sort.key) {
                    th.setAttribute("aria-sort", sort.direction === 1 ? "ascending" : "descending");
                } else {
                    th.removeAttribute("aria-sort");
                }
            });
        }

        Array.prototype.forEach.call(table.tHead.querySelectorAll("th.sortable"), function (th) {
            th.addEventListener("click", function () {
                var key = th.dataset.sort;
                sort.direction = sort.key === key ? -sort.direction : firstDirection[key];
                sort.key = key;
                applySort();
            });
        });

        function filter() {
            var query = fold(search.value.trim());
            var visible = 0;
            rows.forEach(function (row) {
                var match = query === "" || row.dataset.search.indexOf(query) !== -1;
                row.hidden = !match;
                if (match) visible++;
            });
            count.textContent = visible === rows.length
                ? rows.length + " podcasts"
                : visible + " af " + rows.length + " podcasts";
            empty.style.display = visible === 0 ? "block" : "none";
        }

        search.addEventListener("input", filter);
        applySort();
        filter();

        table.tBodies[0].addEventListener("click", function (event) {
            var row = event.target.closest("tr");
            if (!row) return;
            if (event.target.closest("button.copy")) {
                confirmCopy(event.target.closest("button.copy"), row.dataset.slug);
                return;
            }
            var slug = row.dataset.slug;
            document.getElementById("details-title").textContent = row.dataset.title;
            document.getElementById("details-description").textContent = row.dataset.description;
            document.getElementById("details-cover").src = slug + "/image.jpg";
            var link = document.getElementById("details-feed");
            link.href = slug + "/feed.xml";
            link.textContent = feedUrl(slug);
            document.getElementById("details-copy").onclick = function () {
                confirmCopy(this, slug);
            };
            dialog.showModal();
        });

        dialog.addEventListener("click", function (event) {
            if (event.target === dialog || event.target.classList.contains("close")) dialog.close();
        });
    })();
</script>
</body>
</html>
